# Locked container styles

**NEVER modify** `.zmart-shell` or `.zh-wrap` in `resources/css/app.css`, `public/css/app.css`, or anywhere else.

These rules are locked by the project owner and must stay exactly:

```css
.zmart-shell,
.zh-wrap {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: var(--container-width);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 16px;
}
```

Do not:
- Change width / max-width / margin / padding
- Override them in media queries (e.g. `padding-inline: 0` on products section)
- Replace with `min(100% - 40px, …)` or similar

If a layout needs edge-to-edge content, adjust the inner component (e.g. `.pcard-grid`), not the shell.
